source: tests/stages.rs
expression: reports.report(path)
input_file: tests/fixtures/expand/doc_kernel_form_pages.rslisp
---
(def if-page "(if test then else)\n\nEvaluates `then` when the test is true, and `else` otherwise.\n\nIt emits a Rust `if` with an `else`.")
(def fn-page "(fn (parameter ...) body ...)\n\nMakes a function of its parameters, whose result is its last body form.\n\nIt emits a Rust `fn` item, a closure or a block, by where it appears.")
(def match-page "(match value (pattern body ...) ...)\n\nEvaluates the body of the first arm whose pattern matches the value.\n\nAn arm's body is a `do`, so its last form is the arm's value.\n\nA pattern is `_`, a literal, a bare name, `(variant pattern ...)`,\n`(variant :field pattern ...)`, `(type-name pattern ...)` or\n`(type-name :field pattern ...)`. It emits a Rust `match`.")
(def new-page "(new name (field value) ...)\n\nBuilds a struct value from its fields.\n\nA field label is a field name or a keyword, as in `(new car (:year 2025))`.\n`(new _ base (field value) ...)` takes the other fields from a base value.")
